#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_in_hr_holidays.field_hr_leave_type__l10n_in_is_limited_to_optional_days
msgid ""
"Enable this option to restrict Flexi Leave to specific days, ensuring that only days marked as\n"
"        Optional Holidays can be selected. This helps validate that employees can only choose days from the designated\n"
"        Optional Holiday list for their Flexi Leave."
msgstr ""
"启用 this option to restrict Flexi 休假 to specific days, ensuring that only "
"days marked as Optional Holidays can be selected. This helps 验证 that 员工 can "
"only choose days 从 the designated Optional Holiday 列表 for their Flexi 休假."

